{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0042_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "31ca9c7694f102024fb9cbf9c347f97bee0596e0645f9132686c7715c5409c71", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\n運動会ライブ、盛り上がりましたね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了～\n运动会演唱会的气氛相当热烈呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
